English: Take Aaron and Eleazar his son, and bring them up to Mount Hor;

NUM 21:18
Thadou: Hiche tui umna muna chun lengnu apang hoi ahiuvin, lamkai ho ahin, abonchauvin twikhuh chu alaiyun chu in Mattanah lam jon in ache tauvin ahi.
