Thadou: Mimasa hon Sihon thusimho anajihlut un ahile Hesbon lang apat nang ho hung umdol thusim chu hiche ahin Sihon khopi avella kitung doh kit ahiye.
English: Therefore those who speak in proverbs say, “Come to Heshbon. Let the city of Sihon be built and established;

