Thadou: Chule bongchal khat cheh toh to tha dinga lhosohga thilto ding changbong neldisel Ephah dim khat hopsom ma hop thum thaotui jaona hi ding ahi. Kelngoi chal khat toh totha ding changbong neldisel ephah dim khat hopsomma hopni thaotui toh helsa hi ding ahi.
