Thadou: Kelngoi chal sagi ho toh totha ding chun khat cheh chunga chu ephah hopsomma hop khat cheh hidng ahi.
English: and one tenth for every lamb of the seven lambs;

NUM 29:5
Thadou: Chonset nakithoi dam na diu thilto ding chu kelchal khatma hiding ahi.
English: and one male goat for a sin offering, to make atonement for you;

