Thadou: Nili lhinni teng bongchal som hi ding, kelngoi chal ni, kumkhat lhingsa cheh kelngoichal som le li hi ding ahiye.
English: “‘On the fourth day ten bulls, two rams, fourteen male lambs a year old without defect;

