Thadou: Nigup alhinni teng bongchal get hi ding, kelngoichal ni hi ding, kum khat lhingsa cheh kelngoi chal jeng som le li hiding ahi.
English: “‘On the sixth day: eight bulls, two rams, fourteen male lambs a year old without defect;

NUM 29:32
Thadou: Ni sagi lhinni teng bongchal sagi hi ding, kelngoi chal ni, kum khat lhingsa cheh kelngoi chal nolna bei hel som le li cheh jaona hi ding ahiye.
English: “‘On the seventh day: seven bulls, two rams, fourteen male lambs a year old without defect;

NUM 29:35
Thadou: Niget lhinni teng na boncha uva khoppi theng khat na nei diu, natoh hahsa na toh louhel diu ahi.
English: “‘On the eighth day you shall have a solemn assembly. You shall do no regular work;

