Thadou: Ahinlah Pakaija dinga gimnamtui meiya govam thilto na katdoh diu, bongchal khat ahin, kelngoichal khatma ahin, kum khat lhingsa cheh kelngoi chal jeng sagi toh natotha diu ahi.
English: but you shall offer a burnt offering, an offering made by fire, a pleasant aroma to the LORD: one bull, one ram, seven male lambs a year old without defect;

NUM 31:26
Thadou: Nang leh Eleazer thempu ahin, khopi sunga lamkai chengse ahin, gal hinga nahin puiyu mihem ho leh ganchaho jouse a-bonchan simtoh tem’un.
English: “Count the plunder that was taken, both of man and of animal, you, and Eleazar the priest, and the heads of the fathers’ households of the congregation;

