Thadou: Miniamin, Moadiah, Bilgah;
English: Mijamin, Maadiah, Bilgah,

NEH 12:6
Thadou: Shemaiah, Joiarib, Jedaiah;
English: Shemaiah, Joiarib, Jedaiah,

